<%# locals: (occurrence:, position:, total:) -%>

## Occurrence<%= " #{position} of #{total}" if total > 1 %>: <%= occurrence.created_at.utc.iso8601 %>

### Backtrace
<%- occurrence.parsed_backtrace.lines.each do |line| -%>
<%= line.filtered_method ? line.to_s : line.unparsed_line %>
<%- end -%>
<%- if occurrence.context.present? -%>

### Request Context
<%- occurrence.context.each do |key, value| -%>
- <%= key %>: <%= value %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
